1) Get authorization code:
Request:  curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/authorize -H "Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded" -d "client_id=client22" -d "client_secret=secret" -d "grant_type=authorization_code" -d "response_type=code" -d "redirect_uri=http://localhost:3030/client/app"

Response: {"redirectUri":"http://localhost:3030/client/app","authorizationCode":"<REDACTED>","expiresAt":"2019-10-12T06:35:40.533Z","client":{"clientId":"client22","clientSecret":null,"grants":["authorization_code","refresh_token"],"redirectUris":["http://localhost:3030/client/app"]},"user":{"user":1}}

2) Using authorization code to get access token:
Request:  curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/token -H "Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded" -d "client_id=client22" -d "client_secret=secret" -d "grant_type=authorization_code" -d "code=<REDACTED>"
Response: {"accessToken":"<REDACTED>","accessTokenExpiresAt":"2019-10-12T07:30:54.942Z","refreshToken":"<REDACTED>","refreshTokenExpiresAt":"2019-10-26T06:30:54.942Z","client":{"clientId":"client22","clientSecret":"secret","grants":["authorization_code","refresh_token"],"redirectUris":["http://localhost:3030/client/app"]},"user":{"user":1}}
